OL,3,GNEWSARemembering Harry Houdini and his
OL,4,Agreat escape
OL,5,
OL,6,FMagicians in Hull have held a series of
OL,7,Fevents to mark the 100th anniversary of
OL,8,Fthe death of legendary escapologist
OL,9,FHarry Houdini.
OL,11,FThe illusionist performed in the city a
OL,12,Fnumber of times, including escaping
OL,13,Fafter jumping into the Humber from
OL,14,FVictoria Pier while in handcuffs and
OL,15,Fchains in 1914.
OL,17,FJon Marshall, from Hull Magicians'
OL,18,FCircle, said 8,000 people turned up to
OL,19,Fwitness the stunt, which was to
OL,20,Fpublicise his performance at a local
OL,21,Ftheatre.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
